sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User
    participant UI
    participant Ingestion
    participant Parser as LlamaParse
    participant Embed as Embedding Model
    participant Vector as ChromaDB
    participant Graph as Neo4j

    User->>UI: Upload PDF
    UI->>Ingestion: POST /upload

    Ingestion->>Ingestion: Duplicate Check
    Ingestion->>Parser: Parse PDF

    Parser->>Ingestion: Extract Text

    Ingestion->>Ingestion: Chunk Documents
    Ingestion->>Embed: Generate Embeddings

    Embed->>Vector: Store embeddings
    Ingestion->>Graph: Extract entities

    Graph->>Neo4j: Store graph

    Ingestion->>User: Ingestion Complete